{"title":"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Interactive_Teaching_Approach)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser_(SIMPLE_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser (SIMPLE AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The remainder can be defined for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/8/5c8eb2cb0cf3c53328e172b4cf6f48f09f2f8e9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/c/95c21b1ce04c5f3c86f558991d39aa35a13bca21.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{rem} (x ,y)=x-y\\left \\lfloor \\frac{x}{y} \\right \\rfloor\\]\" width=\"170\" height=\"43\" />where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/b/93bb07b9858e6e26bc681f68395ff57e77363228.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left \\lfloor \\tfrac{x}{y} \\right \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"26\" height=\"32\" /> denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/b/8fb4021a1e2f13045a5aef3df30db82490c8cc93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f3dd332d0ae60d38aa4c3cefa4d52c7fc1c9135.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{rem} (\\tfrac{3}{8}, -\\tfrac{2}{5} )$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"83\" height=\"21\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d0489296c9d022335d939e9236f5ee736bda92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -\\frac{3}{8} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } -\\frac{1}{40} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{3}{8} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\frac{31}{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"430\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value, by definition, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/4952d3a491d52ed182ee666da9d7f3e062a95c68.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\text{rem}\\left(\\frac{3}{8},-\\frac{2}{5}\\right) &amp;= \\frac{3}{8}-\\left(-\\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\frac{3}{8}}{-\\frac{2}{5}}\\right\\rfloor \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{3}{8}-\\left(-\\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\left\\lfloor\\frac{3}{8}\\times\\frac{-5}{2}\\right\\rfloor \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{3}{8}-\\left(-\\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\left\\lfloor\\frac{-15}{16}\\right\\rfloor\\\\ &amp;= \\frac{3}{8}-\\left(-\\frac{2}{5}\\right)\\left(-1\\right)\\\\ &amp;= \\frac{3}{8}-\\frac{2}{5}\\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } -\\frac{1}{40}}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"300\" height=\"292\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Do note that the denominator of the answer will be a multiple of 5 and 8 (40) and that the answer will also be negative. The only answer choice that satisfies this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e33ab9a00e021af49e888212645d4667903c49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Interactive_Teaching_Approach.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Interactive_Teaching_Approach)\">Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Interactive Teaching Approach)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=clcMXHuuIZU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=clcMXHuuIZU</a>\n</p><p>~MathkidsbyMax\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/pu_Hqo5sfWs\">https://youtu.be/pu_Hqo5sfWs</a>\n</pre>\n<p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w?t=195\">https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w?t=195</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CrW0Yx5tqV0\">https://youtu.be/CrW0Yx5tqV0</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser_.28SIMPLE_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser_(SIMPLE_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD)\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser (SIMPLE AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by cutoffchaser (SIMPLE AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R6OV0j6VsFY\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R6OV0j6VsFY</a>\n</p><p>~piHard\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A\">2016 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t